od.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"A visible source or a gathered sample if genuinely required. Available materials must be checked before use; no testing equipment is assumed.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, time, materials and learning costs are unknown; specify any actual requirements and limits.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Produce only findings supported by an implemented physical examination, recording uncertainty. Do not grant safety certification, hidden composition knowledge, nutrition, or health benefits merely for requesting, observing or learning.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Roots and berries are covered by starting food-safety knowledge; plums and hazelnuts are not.\\\",\\\"Review the returned assessment specification before committing materials or performing tests. An unsupported safety question may remain unresolved.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer non-ingestive evidence gathering over tasting unfamiliar food.\\\",\\\"Keep food collection bounded by current stock and avoid unnecessary exposure trials that cannot preserve food.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"nearby-food-assessment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"What can direct evidence establish about nearby plums and hazelnuts as potential food sources?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"A direct observational probe at tick 16 recorded plum stock 18 and mature stage.\\\",\\\"A direct observational probe at tick 20 recorded hazelnut stock 5 and mature stage.\\\",\\\"Both observations recorded local growing conditions, not food safety or nutrition.\\\",\\\"Starting food-safety knowledge covers roots and berries, not plums or hazelnuts.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Safety, nutrition and the availability of a useful non-ingestive assessment remain unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Determine whether a feasible examination can provide food-relevant evidence before considering unfamiliar food consumption.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Approached and observationally probed both sources.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Personal observed-state records for the plum and hazelnut sources.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A feasible assessment method and any actual findings concerning food properties.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request a bounded assessment capability and review its requirements and evidential limits.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The observations document source stock and maturity; no dietary or safety benefit has been established.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

